<section class="bhd-page__feature">
  <div>
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Why this team exists</p>
    <h2>A practical hydration problem became a science-first company</h2>
    <p>Best Hydrate began after a serious personal health experience changed how founder Austin thought about hydration. What started as a practical search for a better oral hydration routine developed into a broader effort to understand the physiology, ingredients and real-world contexts that make hydration useful.</p>
    <p>That origin now sits beside health-care experience, academic nutrition science and performance perspectives. The point is not to make one background dominate the others. It is to keep product development connected to the people who use hydration strategies in ordinary life, sport, research and health-care settings.</p>
  </div>
</section>

