  <div class="bhd-page__split-copy">
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">How we work</p>
    <h2>Separate what is known, what is plausible and what still needs evidence</h2>
    <p>Hydration marketing often collapses those categories together. We are building the opposite habit. Basic physiology should be explained accurately, product-specific claims should stay within evidence and authorization, and research questions should remain labelled as research questions until results exist.</p>
    <p>That discipline is why the public site now separates hydration science, formula rationale, current research, clinical development and application pages instead of treating them as interchangeable proof.</p>
    <a class="bhd-page__text-link" href="/pages/research-publications">Explore Research & Impact →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bhd-page__cards-section">
